[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13324.51, "timestamp": "03:42:04", "text": "它。而进步本身就是一本书。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13327.67, "timestamp": "03:42:07", "text": "陷阱。所以，它仍然显示我是第一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13330.269, "timestamp": "03:42:10", "text": "所以，我应该睡觉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13356.71, "timestamp": "03:42:36", "text": "先睡一会儿吧。我认为我可以保留"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13360.229, "timestamp": "03:42:40", "text": "船在这边。我仍然深陷其中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13363.429, "timestamp": "03:42:43", "text": "冒险航行之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13371.55, "timestamp": "03:42:51", "text": "停止。我希望这些教程内容是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13374.79, "timestamp": "03:42:54", "text": "走了。我知道有个教程……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13377.55, "timestamp": "03:42:57", "text": "结尾。我不能在教程的结尾处结束……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13379.309, "timestamp": "03:42:59", "text": "那里，"}]